{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-basics","title":"电商供应链基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals/supply-chain-basics","wordCount":1104,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"电商供应链基础\">电商供应链基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>供应链是从原材料到最终消费者的价值链路，电商供应链的核心挑战在于需求不确定性高、SKU 数量大、交付时效要求严格。与传统零售的&quot;推式&quot;供应链不同，电商更倾向&quot;拉式&quot;或&quot;推拉结合&quot;的策略——根据实际订单驱动下游配送，同时基于预测提前布局上游库存。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 上游&#10;        A[供应商] --&gt; B[原材料/成品]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 中游&#10;        B --&gt; C[中心仓]&#10;        C --&gt; D[区域仓]&#10;        D --&gt; E[前置仓]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 下游&#10;        E --&gt; F[配送站]&#10;        F --&gt; G[消费者]&#10;    end&#10;    H[需求预测] -.-&gt; C&#10;    H -.-&gt; D&#10;    H -.-&gt; E&#10;    I[订单信号] -.-&gt; F\">graph LR\n    subgraph 上游\n        A[供应商] --&gt; B[原材料/成品]\n    end\n    subgraph 中游\n        B --&gt; C[中心仓]\n        C --&gt; D[区域仓]\n        D --&gt; E[前置仓]\n    end\n    subgraph 下游\n        E --&gt; F[配送站]\n        F --&gt; G[消费者]\n    end\n    H[需求预测] -.-&gt; C\n    H -.-&gt; D\n    H -.-&gt; E\n    I[订单信号] -.-&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>供应链模式</th>\n<th>驱动力</th>\n<th>库存策略</th>\n<th>响应时效</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推式（Push）</td>\n<td>需求预测</td>\n<td>预置库存</td>\n<td>慢（生产周期）</td>\n<td>标品、稳定需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉式（Pull）</td>\n<td>实际订单</td>\n<td>按需生产/调拨</td>\n<td>快（配送周期）</td>\n<td>定制品、长尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推拉结合</td>\n<td>预测+订单</td>\n<td>关键节点缓冲</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>主流电商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟制造</td>\n<td>半成品库存</td>\n<td>最晚差异化</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多品类平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"需求预测与计划\">需求预测与计划</h2><p>需求预测是供应链计划的起点，决定了采购量、生产量和库存分布。电商需求预测的难度在于长尾效应（20% 的 SKU 贡献 80% 的销售额，但 80% 的 SKU 需求波动大）、促销影响（大促期间销量可能是日常的 10-50 倍）和新品冷启动（无历史数据）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DemandForecast {&#10;  sku: string;&#10;  forecastPeriod: { start: string; end: string };&#10;  baselineForecast: number;&#10;  adjustments: {&#10;    promotionalLift: number;&#10;    seasonalFactor: number;&#10;    trendComponent: number;&#10;    externalEvents: number;&#10;  };&#10;  finalForecast: number;&#10;  confidenceInterval: {&#10;    lower: number;&#10;    upper: number;&#10;    confidence: number;&#10;  };&#10;  model: {&#10;    type: &#39;statistical&#39; | &#39;ml&#39; | &#39;hybrid&#39;;&#10;    name: string;&#10;    accuracy: { mae: number; mape: number; bias: number };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DemandForecast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  forecastPeriod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  baselineForecast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  adjustments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    promotionalLift</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    seasonalFactor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    trendComponent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    externalEvents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  finalForecast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidenceInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lower</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    upper</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'statistical'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ml'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hybrid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    accuracy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mae</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>预测模型的选择取决于数据量和需求特征。时间序列模型（ARIMA、Prophet）适合历史数据充足的标品，机器学习模型（LightGBM、DeepAR）在特征丰富时表现更优，新品预测则需要基于类似商品的迁移学习或专家判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预测方法</th>\n<th>数据要求</th>\n<th>准确度</th>\n<th>适用SKU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指数平滑</td>\n<td>低（12期+）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>标品、稳定需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARIMA/SARIMA</td>\n<td>中（24期+）</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>有季节性的标品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prophet</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>有促销和节假日影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LightGBM</td>\n<td>高（多特征）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大规模SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepAR</td>\n<td>高（多序列）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>相关SKU群组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类似品迁移</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>新品冷启动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"库存网络与分仓策略\">库存网络与分仓策略</h2><p>库存网络设计决定了商品存放在哪些仓库、每个仓库存多少。目标是在服务水平（配送时效）和库存成本（仓储费+资金占用）之间找到最优平衡。</p>\n<p>电商的仓网层级通常为：中心仓（CDC，覆盖全国，SKU 全）→ 区域仓（RDC，覆盖大区，SKU 精选）→ 前置仓（FDC，覆盖 3-5 公里，高频 SKU）。库存越下沉，配送越快但库存成本越高。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface WarehouseNetwork {&#10;  warehouses: {&#10;    id: string;&#10;    type: &#39;cdc&#39; | &#39;rdc&#39; | &#39;fdc&#39; | &#39;micro_fulfillment&#39;;&#10;    location: { lat: number; lng: number; city: string };&#10;    capacity: {&#10;      storageArea: number;&#10;      dailyOrders: number;&#10;      skuCount: number;&#10;    };&#10;    coverage: {&#10;      radiusKm: number;&#10;      deliveryPromise: string;&#10;      coveredPopulation: number;&#10;    };&#10;    costs: {&#10;      rentPerSqm: number;&#10;      laborPerOrder: number;&#10;      utilityMonthly: number;&#10;    };&#10;  }[];&#10;  inventoryPolicy: {&#10;    allocationModel: &#39;push&#39; | &#39;pull&#39; | &#39;hybrid&#39;;&#10;    safetyStockMethod: &#39;fixed&#39; | &#39;dynamic&#39; | &#39;service_level_based&#39;;&#10;    replenishmentTrigger: &#39;reorder_point&#39; | &#39;periodic&#39; | &#39;demand_driven&#39;;&#10;    interWarehouseTransfer: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WarehouseNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  warehouses</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cdc'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rdc'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fdc'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'micro_fulfillment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lng</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">city</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    capacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      storageArea</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      dailyOrders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      skuCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    coverage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      radiusKm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      deliveryPromise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      coveredPopulation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    costs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      rentPerSqm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      laborPerOrder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      utilityMonthly</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inventoryPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    allocationModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'push'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pull'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hybrid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    safetyStockMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fixed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dynamic'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'service_level_based'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    replenishmentTrigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reorder_point'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'periodic'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'demand_driven'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    interWarehouseTransfer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分仓的核心算法是库存分配优化（Inventory Allocation Optimization）。输入变量包括各仓库的覆盖区域需求预测、仓储成本、运输成本和服务水平要求，输出是每个 SKU 在每个仓库的目标库存量。这本质上是一个多约束优化问题，常用线性规划或启发式算法求解。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库类型</th>\n<th>覆盖半径</th>\n<th>SKU 数量</th>\n<th>配送时效</th>\n<th>单位成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中心仓 CDC</td>\n<td>全国</td>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>2-5天</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区域仓 RDC</td>\n<td>300-500km</td>\n<td>20-40%</td>\n<td>1-2天</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前置仓 FDC</td>\n<td>3-5km</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>30分钟-2小时</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微仓 MFC</td>\n<td>1-3km</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>15-30分钟</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"供应商协同\">供应商协同</h2><p>供应商管理是供应链上游的核心环节。电商平台与供应商的协同程度直接影响到货率、采购成本和库存周转率。VMI（供应商管理库存）模式下，供应商基于平台共享的销售和库存数据自主决定补货时间和数量，减少了平台的采购管理负担。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface SupplierCollaboration {&#10;  supplier: {&#10;    id: string;&#10;    name: string;&#10;    leadTime: { average: number; p95: number };&#10;    minimumOrderQuantity: number;&#10;    orderFrequency: &#39;daily&#39; | &#39;weekly&#39; | &#39;biweekly&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  performance: {&#10;    onTimeDeliveryRate: number;&#10;    qualityRejectRate: number;&#10;    fillRate: number;&#10;    responseTime: number;&#10;  };&#10;  integration: {&#10;    dataSharing: (&#39;inventory&#39; | &#39;forecast&#39; | &#39;pos&#39; | &#39;promotion&#39;)[];&#10;    orderMethod: &#39;edi&#39; | &#39;api&#39; | &#39;portal&#39; | &#39;email&#39;;&#10;    inventoryVisibility: &#39;none&#39; | &#39;partial&#39; | &#39;full&#39;;&#10;    vmiEnabled: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;  scorecardWeights: {&#10;    quality: number;&#10;    delivery: number;&#10;    cost: number;&#10;    responsiveness: number;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SupplierCollaboration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    leadTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">average</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p95</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    minimumOrderQuantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    orderFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'daily'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'weekly'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'biweekly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  performance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    onTimeDeliveryRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    qualityRejectRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fillRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    responseTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  integration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dataSharing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inventory'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'forecast'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pos'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'promotion'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    orderMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'edi'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'api'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'portal'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'email'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    inventoryVisibility</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'partial'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'full'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    vmiEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scorecardWeights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    quality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    delivery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    responsiveness</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协同模式</th>\n<th>数据共享程度</th>\n<th>库存责任</th>\n<th>适用关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传统采购</td>\n<td>低（订单级）</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>一般供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT 准时制</td>\n<td>中（计划级）</td>\n<td>共担</td>\n<td>核心供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VMI</td>\n<td>高（实时库存+销售）</td>\n<td>供应商</td>\n<td>战略供应商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPFR</td>\n<td>最高（联合预测）</td>\n<td>联合决策</td>\n<td>深度合作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>电商供应链以&quot;推拉结合&quot;为主流模式——上游基于预测推式备货，下游基于订单拉式配送</li>\n<li>需求预测是供应链计划的起点，长尾 SKU 和大促场景是预测的最大挑战</li>\n<li>仓网层级（CDC → RDC → FDC → MFC）通过库存下沉加速配送，但库存成本随之上升</li>\n<li>库存分配优化在服务水平和库存成本之间寻找最优解，是供应链运筹学的核心问题</li>\n<li>VMI 和 CPFR 等深度协同模式通过供应商数据共享提升整体供应链效率</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电商供应链基础","id":"电商供应链基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"需求预测与计划","id":"需求预测与计划"},{"level":2,"text":"库存网络与分仓策略","id":"库存网络与分仓策略"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商协同","id":"供应商协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电商物流全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-overview"},"next":{"title":"电商物流模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-models"}}